+    {
+      "type": "text",
+      "title": "How to use them",
+      "content": "*Cualquiera* is a pronoun: it stands alone or comes before *que*. Before a noun it becomes *cualquier*: *cualquier persona que llegue*. *Quienquiera* and *dondequiera* are each one word. After all of them comes *que* and the subjunctive. *Cualquiera que sea…* is the usual way to say \"whatever … is\"."
